```json
{
  "verdict": "approve | reject",
  "category": "valid | overreach | unreachable_trigger | noise | non_behavioral",
  "reasoning": "1-3 sentences. Quote the relevant span of the targeted spec text (or note its silence on the relevant property), and explain how the printed divergence does or does not follow from that text."
